aving throw or take 17 (2d6 + 10) bludgeoning damage and be knocked prone. The dragon can then fly up to half its flying speed. Acciones legendarias. The dragon can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature''s turn. The dragon regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","alignment":"Caótico maligno","source":"srd-5.1"}'::jsonb, 'srd-5.1'),
